first_claim:
An RNA that demonstrates anti-HIV infection activity and is employed in prevention and treatment of AIDS, wherein said RNA is selected from the group consisting of 
a single strand RNA having SEQ ID NO: 8; 
a single strand RNA having a fragment of SEQ ID NO:8; 
a double strand RNA derived by annealing of SEQ ID NO:8 and the complimentary sequence therof; 
a double strand RNA derived by annealing of a fragment of SEQ ID NO:8 and the complimentary sequence therof:
 ( 1) acagccgccuagcauuucaucac (SEQ ID NO: 8); 
wherein said fragment of SEQ ID NO:8 is selected from the group consisting of a 18 nt fragment of SEQ ID NO:8; 
a 19 nt fragment of SEQ ID NO:8; 
a 20 nt fragment of SEQ ID NO:8; 
a 21 nt fragment of SEQ ID NO:8; 
a 22 nt fragment of SEQ ID NO:8.

